  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Version: 2019.2.4\n\nDescription of the bug:\n\nIf you press the sit/stand mode button while another player is behind the button in question, in some cases the menu will switch to the user detail screen and (if you double press the trigger for example) may result in an accidental mute. A video demonstrating this issue is here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bKiTRsw6fxU&feature=youtu.be\n\n立ち・座りモードボタンを押すとき、後ろにプレイヤーがいる場合はたまにプレイヤー情報画面に切り替えて、トリガーの二度押しなどで間違えてミュートにしてしまうことがあります。再現動画はこちらです→https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bKiTRsw6fxU&feature=youtu.be\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\n1. In VR mode (no full body tracking), hold up your quick menu so that the sit/stand button is overlapping another player\n2. Spam the trigger 2-3 times\n3. Repeat 1-2 with different angles until you mute someone\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bKiTRsw6fxU&feature=youtu.be",
